    "detailed_description": "<i> <strong> Mouse Hunter </strong> </i> - a puzzle game with a top view, executed in 2D graphics, where you have to catch the mouse.<br>The essence of the game is simple - you need to prevent the mouse from reaching the cheese by placing mousetraps, but in reality this task is not an easy one. The course of the game: a mouse appears on the map with a heap of cheese and one by one you place a mousetrap that should prevent it, and it takes a step, including diagonally. Victory is awarded if the mouse is trapped or surrounded by them without the possibility of a move.<br><i> Complete all 100 levels and catch annoying thief mice! </i>",
